{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13106050","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13106050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1310605001:0":{"text":"「ゴーストハウス」に参加する方はこちらへどうぞ！","source_cn":"参加“鬼影密室”项目的朋友们，请走这里呦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FD20B455CE1C4A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310605002:1":{"text":"知ってます！地下室に行くんですよね！","source_cn":"我们知道，是在地下室举办的，对吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B6CE3085D01E8DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310605003:1":{"text":"そ、その通りだべ。はい、これが「ルール説明」。問題がなければ、このまま中に入って。","source_cn":"……没错，亲爱的。喏，这是“游戏规则书”，如果没有问题...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x609369BA2C7C26A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310605004:1":{"text":"最初に密室を出た優勝者には、花びらをあげるよ！","source_cn":"第一位走出密室的朋友就是赢家，能得到一枚花瓣！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25FF1E63876DBBEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格尔达":{"text":"ガルダ","source":"格尔达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}